<title>UK: IADB sets C$100 million six-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets C$100 million six-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ScotiaMcLeod Inc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	C$100 MLN   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    10.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.45    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 SEPT 2001 CANADIAN GOVERNMENT BOND -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
